OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy to start Sunday
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of light and patchy
OL,7,Frain possible. Drier through the
OL,8,Fafternoon with sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud increasing overnight,
OL,13,Fwith the odd spot of rain and drizzle.
OL,14,FA rather mild night under the blanket
OL,15,Fof cloud with light westerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA cloudy Monday with isolated
OL,18,Fspots of light patchy rain possible.
OL,19,FTurning drier later. Cooler around
OL,20,Fcoasts but still feeling pleasantly
OL,21,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
